<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>!</p>

<p>Someone has requested a link to change your password. You can do this through the link below.</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Change my password', edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token), style: 'color: #5F7A61; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;' %></p>

<p>If you didn't request this, please ignore this email. Your password won't change until you access the link above and create a new one.</p>

<p style="color: #6B625C; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 24px;">— Jess Sullivan</p>
